This is EXPERIMENTAL firmware and is not intended for deployment use. In particular:

- It may dissipate significantly (!!!) more power than "normal" firmware;
  thermal management is non-trivial an can result in unexpected board reboots
  and possibly even damage.

- The 100G streamer (including packet format) is expected to be different and
  is not yet integrated into our software stack (on this or any other branch).

This firmware also requires a "post-yocto migration" (firmware r1.7.0 or newer)
u-boot; see ../r1.7.0 for details.
